  "content": "```html\n<p><a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fwww.modrinth.com%252fmod%252frp-renames\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/HiWord9/RPRenames/extra/links/modrinth.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"75\" height=\"75\"></a><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/rp-renames\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/HiWord9/RPRenames/extra/links/curseforge.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"75\" height=\"75\"></a><a href=\"https://github.com/HiWord9/RPRenames\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/HiWord9/RPRenames/extra/links/github.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"75\" height=\"75\"></a><a href=\"https://discord.gg/3Q699k7qHr\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://github.com/HiWord9/RPRenames/blob/extra/links/discord.png?raw=true\" alt=\"\" width=\"75\" height=\"75\"></a><a style=\"background-color:rgb(13, 13, 13);font-family:Lato, &amp;#x27;font-weight:400;color:#e5e5e5\" href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fwww.paypal.me%252fhiword9\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/HiWord9/RPRenames/extra/links/paypal.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"75\" height=\"75\"></a><img src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/HiWord9/RPRenames/extra/links/thx4donation.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"225\" height=\"75\"></p>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<h2>在您的魔獸世界鐵砧選單中，隨時查看您資源包中的所有 CIT 和 CEM 更名！</h2>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<h3>NeoForge:</h3>\n<div class=\"spoiler\">\n<p>RP Renames 可透過 <a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/sinytra-connector\" rel=\"nofollow\">Sinytra Connector</a> 和 <a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/forgified-fabric-api\" rel=\"nofollow\">Forgified Fabric Api</a> 在 NeoForge 上使用。您還需要安裝 <a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/cit-resewn-neopatcher\" rel=\"nofollow\">CITResewnNeoPatcher</a> 並搭配 <a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/cit-resewn\" rel=\"nofollow\">CITResewn</a> 才能在 NeoForge 上使用 CIT 封包，請參閱其頁面以取得更多資訊。</p>\n</div>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<p>這是一個客戶端模組，幫助您在資源包中搜尋適合您工具或其他物品的良好自訂設定。它會顯示所有新紋理所需的完整名稱列表，您只需點擊即可為您的物品提供全新外觀！</p>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<p><img src=\"https://cdn.modrinth.com/data/cached_images/84eb41c031698153b87e4c63961f72342007a6e7.png\" alt=\"CIT List\" width=\"720\" height=\"344\"></p>\n<p><img src=\"https://cdn.modrinth.com/data/hvqcuDMT/images/713c175aecc1eaffa7a715bdef732e30c11bcce1.png\" alt=\"預覽！\" width=\"720\" height=\"898\"></p>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<p>創意標籤頁！</p>\n<p><img src=\"https://cdn.modrinth.com/data/hvqcuDMT/images/c449b37cc335faeaa049de72f736fac23670c55e.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"400\" height=\"338\"></p>\n<p>CEM 支援！</p>\n<p><img src=\"https://cdn.modrinth.com/data/hvqcuDMT/images/e0d9636c217069d9af43733828e306a0f4d8d383.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"400\" height=\"377\"></p>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<p><img src=\"https://cdn.modrinth.com/data/hvqcuDMT/images/9bb2bceef6b3eb0f255f0fd7308de58bec433e86.png\" alt=\"內建資源包！\" width=\"720\" height=\"230\"></p>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<p>全新的角色扮演體驗！您再也不需要在資源包網站或其他地方的大型列表中搜尋單一更名，現在它就就在您的魔獸世界中！</p>\n```",
